{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "647fa32b-edfa-8269-a94b-11f442b7ce7f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:34:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "David Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:32:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:32:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. Good afternoon. I know City Hall is closed today, it is Sunday, but my neighbor said this is the number for storm problems. Is this right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:32:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place. The storm line stays open on weekends. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:32:39-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I am David Gifford, I am at 317 Farewell Street, in the North End. The parking lot behind our building, it slopes down toward the back door. After the nor'easter, the one from Friday into Saturday, yesterday, the water comes all the way to the door and floods the entrance. Everything is wet inside the doorway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:32:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Is the water still standing there now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still some, yes. It is going down slowly. And my neighbor, he tells me it happens every big rain. Every one! So this is not new, you understand. Nobody fixes it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there a storm drain in the lot, do you know, or does the water just run toward the door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:33:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is one drain, I think, but it is full of leaves and, um, [line breaks up] it does not take the water. The water goes to the door instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up for a second. You said the drain's full of leaves and not taking water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:33:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, exactly. Full. And the lot is sloped wrong, so it all runs to the back door. Every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:33:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll write this up for the crew as a drainage problem at the back lot, 317 Farewell, with the water reaching the entrance. Crews are stretched after a storm like this, so I can't give you an hour, but it'll be in the queue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:33:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please, can somebody call me back when it is done? I want to know it is finished. My number is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:34:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, 401-555-0194, I'll note a call back once it's done. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a cell. Very old one. My phone is older than you, I think. Maybe that is why the line is breaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:34:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't worry, I heard you fine for the most part. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you. Please do not forget us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T12:34:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I won't. Take care, Mr. Gifford."
    }
  ],
